      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">DP - state machine</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Stocks</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/best-time-to-buy-and-sell-stock-iii/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 123</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Best Time to Buy and Sell Stock III</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">At most two trades, never holding two shares. Track four running bests while you scan the prices: the best balance after the first buy, the first sell, the second buy and the second sell. Each one reads the one before it, so a single pass gives the answer in O(n) time and O(1) space. The same four lines generalise to k trades.</p>\n"
  },
